BlueBubbles Rust
A lightweight Rust client for BlueBubbles.

This independent community client interoperates with the BlueBubbles server.
The bundled BlueBubbles icon is from the BlueBubbles project:
https://github.com/BlueBubblesApp/bluebubbles-app
Copyright the BlueBubbles contributors. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.

The Rust client was developed with reference to the upstream BlueBubbles client
and server API implementations. Changes include a native Rust/egui Linux
interface, standalone packaging, and Rust implementations of the API client,
local cache, Firebase URL recovery, and background notifications.

BlueBubbles names and branding belong to their respective owners. This repository
is not an official BlueBubbles release or an assertion of upstream endorsement.
